# Scenario: career coach identifies overlapping skills for three data-related roles.
venn "Data-role skills overlap"
set analyst "Data analyst"
set engineer "Data engineer"
set scientist "Data scientist"
analyst only: "Dashboard design"
engineer only: "Pipelines"
scientist only: "Experimentation"
analyst & engineer: "SQL"
analyst & scientist: "Statistics"
engineer & scientist: "Python"
analyst & engineer & scientist: "Data literacy"
